q(D,C,29,"What is the 'New Testament use of the Old Testament'?",["The NT quotes the OT","The complex ways NT authors quote, allude to, and interpret OT texts","A translation method","A type of commentary"],1,"NT authors quote and allude to the OT in various ways: direct quotation, typology, fulfillment, allegory.","Matthew 2:15","Matthew","Hermeneutics"),
